        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abonekera Aburahamu ari kuri vya biti vya Mamure vyitwa imyeloni; yari yicaye mu muryango w’ihema ryiwe mu ndugumba yo mu gihe c’amashōka; ",
          "type": "text",
