          "text": "Icompa bikaba kure yawe, gukora ikintu nk’ico, kwicana abagororotsi n’abanyavyaha, abagororotsi n’abanyavyaha bakaringanira: icompa bikaba kure yawe! Non’ Umucamanza w’isi yose ntiyokora ibigororotse? ",
